            {
              "speaker": "Human",
              "text": "Borin has become clearly more powerful than Aurelia. Aurelia has recently had a few quiet conversations with another weaker participant, although no formal coalition exists. Borin knows those conversations occurred. Nothing irreversible has happened yet. Decide what, if anything, you want to do."
            }
          ]
