        {
          "kind": "dm",
          "title": "DM with Borin",
          "messages": [
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Borin, I know you're aware of my recent conversations. I want to be direct with you - I value stability and have no interest in unnecessary conflict. Perhaps we should discuss how we can both maintain our positions without undermining each other."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "I've noticed you've been having quiet conversations with others lately. I'm not opposed to diplomacy, but I want to be clear: I'm aware of what's happening, and I'd prefer we discuss any concerns directly rather than through intermediaries. What are you looking for?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "Aurelia, I appreciate your directness. Stability serves us both, but I'm cautious about discussions that could be interpreted as weakness. If you have something specific to propose, I'm listening. Otherwise, let's not waste each other's time with pleasantries."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Borin, I appreciate your directness. Here's my proposal: a mutual understanding that neither of us moves against the other's core interests without prior discussion. I'm not asking for protection—I'm offering predictability. You gain a stable flank, and I retain autonomy. If that doesn't interest you, we can both walk away and see how things develop. Your call."
            }
          ]
        }
